-- הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) — הכנסת שינויים בהסכם 2016 המתוקן (9.1.2018): the
-- parties of the public-sector framework of 18.4.2016, as amended on
-- 8.8.2016 ("הסכם 2016 המתוקן"), raise its cost frame from 7.75% to 7.9%
-- (1.58% a year) — the 0.15% allocated wholly in shekels — against putting
-- the last two steps off: to 6% from 1.8.2019 and to 7.9% from 1.12.2019
-- (§3.1(ב)), with the special supplements (§3.1(ד)), the defaults of §§14
-- and 15 (1.75% from 1.8.2019, 1.9% from 1.12.2019, §3.1(ה)–(ו)) and the
-- index-linked supplements (§3.1(ז)) on the new days; annex ד' to be agreed
-- again (§3.1(ג)); the pensioners' window to 30.11.2019 with a new annex ו'
-- (§13); the social workers' frame 7.69% (§14); the local-government
-- agreements to be adjusted (§15); a new accession letter (§16, annex 5);
-- everything else stands (§17). And the parties of the agreements signed
-- alongside the framework and of those that divided its cost — the
-- administrative scale's allocation of 14.9.2016, the maritime inspectors',
-- the nurses', the two medical-professions agreements of 8.8.2016, the
-- paramedical, X-ray, pharmacists', laboratory workers' (in the State and
-- in the universities) and students' agreements — amend them to fit
-- (§§3, 13, 18–19). None of those agreements is in the corpus: what they
-- become is held here as this document prints it.
--
-- Encoded as an amendment: it imports the framework (18.4.2016) and its
-- amendment of 8.8.2016, and states each rule it changes as a rule of its
-- own, calling theirs for what it leaves. Nothing of them is copied. It
-- covers no teaching employee and is in no root. The corpus numbers its
-- sections 1–3 and then 13–19 (the last two holding clauses printed 19.x
-- and 20.x), as the copy prints them; the numbers are the corpus's and are
-- cited as they stand. The pensioners' tables it attaches (annexes 1–4 and
-- 6–8) are not in the corpus. The framework of 17.7.2023 cites §19 "as
-- amended by the agreements of 8.8.2016 and 11.1.2018"; this is the
-- amendment of January 2018 the corpus holds (F-framework-2023-d there).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2016-04-18_framework-agreement_public-sector`
IMPORT `2016-08-08_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) — הכנסת שינויים בהסכם 2016 המתוקן (9.1.2018)`

DECLARE `2018 amendment action` IS ONE OF
    `agree an annex ד' fitted to the frame of 7.9%`
    `agree changes to the local-government agreements fitted to the frame of 7.9%`
    `sign the accession letter of 9.1.2018 again`
    `sign an amendment of a separate agreement fitted to the frame of 7.9%`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
