-- §19, 20.1: the first medical-professions agreement of 8.8.2016
-- (physiotherapists, occupational therapists, paramedical staff, and the
-- social workers of the Ministry of Health, Clalit, Hadassah and the two
-- cities' hospitals): (1) in its §4, 10.4% for 10.25% and 7.9 for 7.75; (2)
-- 5.6: from 1.8.2019 to 8.5%; (3) 5.7: from 1.12.2019 to 10.4%; (4) in its
-- §14, 1.8.2019 for 1.12.2018 throughout, "31.5.2018" for 30.9.2018, and
-- August 2019, September 2019 and August's differences for December 2018,
-- January 2019 and December's; (5) in its §15, a default of 1.9% from
-- 1.12.2019 for 1.75% from 1.3.2019, 30.9.2019 for 31.12.2018, 1.12.2019
-- for 1.3.2019, 1.9% for 1.75% (and in D), and December 2019, January 2020
-- and December's differences for March, April and March's; (6) in its §16,
-- 10.19% for 10.04%; (7) in its §17, the eligible retiree is one who
-- retired from 1 January 2013 to 30 November 2019 in its §3's scales, and
-- annex 6 replaces its table; (ב) nothing else changes.
