-- to 31.5.2018 — earlier, against the steps this agreement puts off — where
-- §3.1(ה) gives the framework's same default 31.5.2019 and 20.3(4)(ב) the
-- second medical agreement's 31.5.2019; read 31.5.2019 (convention
-- reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_19__para_20-1 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_3 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_a akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_b akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_c akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_c__pnt_1 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_c__pnt_2 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_4__pnt_c__pnt_3 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_a akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_b akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_c akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_d akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_e akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_f akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_f__pnt_1 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_f__pnt_2 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_5__pnt_f__pnt_3 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_6 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_7 akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_7__pnt_a akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_a__cls_7__pnt_b akn:art_19__para_20-1__subpara_b
`the figures 20.1 of 2018 sets` MEANS
    LIST `2018 amended figure` "הסכם הרפואיים אחד" "4" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2019) (10.4%),
         `2018 amended figure` "הסכם הרפואיים אחד" "5.6" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2019) (8.5%),
         `2018 amended figure` "הסכם הרפואיים אחד" "5.7" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2019) (10.4%),
         `2018 amended figure` "הסכם הרפואיים אחד" "16" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2019) (10.19%)

-- Every rate it raises rises by the framework's 0.15%: 10.25% to 10.4%,
-- 7.75% to 7.9%, 10.04% to 10.19%; and its last default (1.9%) is its
-- last step's rise (10.4% − 8.5%), as the framework's.
#ASSERT 10.4% MINUS 10.25% EQUALS `the 2018 rise of the frame`
#ASSERT 10.19% MINUS 10.04% EQUALS `the 2018 rise of the frame`
#ASSERT 10.4% MINUS 8.5% EQUALS 1.9%

`the last day to agree 20.1's §14 default, as printed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2018
`the last day to agree 20.3's §14 default` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2019
`the last day to agree the framework's §14 default, as amended in 2018` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2019
`the last day 20.1's §14 had` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2018

`20.1 moves its default's last day earlier, where the others move it a year on` MEANS
        DATE_SERIAL `the last day to agree 20.1's §14 default, as printed` LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the last day 20.1's §14 had`
    AND `the last day to agree 20.3's §14 default` EQUALS `the last day to agree the framework's §14 default, as amended in 2018`
    AND NOT (`the last day to agree 20.1's §14 default, as printed` EQUALS `the last day to agree 20.3's §14 default`)

#ASSERT `20.1 moves its default's last day earlier, where the others move it a year on`

`the last day to agree 20.1's §14 default, as read` MEANS `the last day to agree 20.3's §14 default`

-- The framework's own §14 default of 2018 is agreed by the same day.
#ASSERT (at `the defaults of the 2016 framework, as amended in 2018` 2)'s `the agreement's last day` EQUALS `the last day to agree 20.1's §14 default, as read`

