-- Every figure §§18–19 set takes effect on one of the two new days.
`every figure of §§18–19 of 2018` MEANS
    concat (LIST `the shekel sums §18 of 2018 sets`, `the figures 20.1 of 2018 sets`, `the figures 20.2 of 2018 sets`,
                 `the figures 20.3 of 2018 sets`, `the shekel sums 20.4–20.6 of 2018 set`, `the figures 20.7 of 2018 sets`,
                 `the students' sums 20.8 of 2018 sets`)

#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD elem (f's `in force from`) (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2019, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2019)) `every figure of §§18–19 of 2018`

-- Every shekel sum grows from its August to its December figure.
GIVEN fs IS A LIST OF `2018 amended figure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `each pair of 2018 sums grows` fs IF
    all (GIVEN k YIELD (at fs (2 TIMES k))'s `the figure` LESS THAN (at fs (2 TIMES k PLUS 1))'s `the figure`)
        (filter (GIVEN k YIELD 2 TIMES k PLUS 1 LESS THAN count fs) (LIST 0, 1, 2))

#ASSERT `each pair of 2018 sums grows` `the shekel sums §18 of 2018 sets`
#ASSERT `each pair of 2018 sums grows` `the students' sums 20.8 of 2018 sets`

